#: scenario8:scenario8_ECF573D7_FB0B_4034_A893_9BA6A3DEC58B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7cf51a6af4f326b5c3815dfd50387183e32b81fe3bced09035241be3c503b847
