msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Fair enough, I guess.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Though put yourself in my shoes for a sec.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"I came in and you were still as a corpse."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Immagino di sì.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Però mettiti nei miei panni per un secondo.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"Quando sono entrato eri immobile come un cadavere."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9D58FD95_61D2_4B18_90E9_8E305D5AD827
