"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The lord and... ⟪k:3⟫his bodyguard?⟪k:4⟫They’re only around early mornings and "
"nights,⟪k:5⟫so I doubt either of them are here right now..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il lord e... ⟪k:3⟫la sua guardia?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Si vedono in giro solo la mattina "
"presto e la notte,⟪k:6⟫per cui dubito che siano qui al momento..."

