#: scenario8:scenario8_C81F0E3B_6618_46FA_9D91_E6701D26E623
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 473ec3acd95946c8185a2f3a2788f6d8b08f21ff4d6324849fc5027607562e09
